.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-security-group-rules-set - Replace the rules of a security group


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro security-group rules set  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Replace the rules of a security group

.PP
Full replace (inbound + outbound), max 60 rules. Applied to every attached server. If the change removes or narrows SSH (22) / RDP (3389) access for any source on an attached server, or cuts the calling address, it runs as a 5 minute trial (\fBtrial: true\fR, \fBtrial_seconds_left\fR) - the same rule as the panel, CLI and Terraform: confirm with POST .../confirm, otherwise the previous rules return. A server's rules (own + all attached groups) must fit its allowance (422 err_sg_quota).

.PP
API: PUT /cloud/security-groups/{sg}/rules (operationId putSecurityGroupRules, scope cloud_write)


